<report>
<title>Odds ratio analysis</title>

<p>Odds Ratio = @{odds:roundu}</p>

<p>Using the Woolf (logit) approximation:<br />
<ci>Approximate @{woolf_ci:roundu}% confidence interval = @{woolf_ci_1:roundu} to @{woolf_ci_2:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>Using conditional likelihood estimation:<br />
<ci>Fisher exact @ci% confidence interval = @{llf:roundu} to @{ulf:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided @{p1f:pval}, two sided @{p2f:pval}</pval><br />
<ci>mid-P exact @ci% confidence interval = @{llm:roundu} to @{ulm:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided @{p1m:pval}, two sided @{p2m:pval}</pval></p>
</report>
